p=Path('README.md');s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig');s+='\n## Preview navigation\nProject library and image grids support Ctrl + wheel thumbnail scaling (60–180%), remembered independently. The percentage button resets to 100%; minus/plus controls provide equivalent actions. Coverflow has a small All control with partial/all/none selection states. Hover or focus a project to open its translucent nine-cell preview; placement follows available viewport space. Scroll to browse further images and click a thumbnail to open it. Escape or moving away closes the preview.\n';p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
p=Path('DESIGN.md');s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig');s+='\nProject hover previews use a borderless, translucent surface with three columns and at most three visible rows. Use top-layer popovers so grid clipping never hides them. Prefer beside-card placement, flip at viewport edges, clamp on small screens. A short hover delay and pointer bridge keep previews stable. Preview wheel scrolling is contained. Project/image thumbnail zoom is separate from page or canvas zoom.\n';p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
